a minor for a drive?

501
00:30:52,458 --> 00:30:55,333
Just so you know,
if it means protecting her…

502
00:30:56,791 --> 00:30:58,833
I'll cut down anyone who stands in my way!

503
00:31:01,458 --> 00:31:02,375
What the hell?

504
00:31:02,458 --> 00:31:04,041
You people are nuts!

505
00:31:06,666 --> 00:31:09,333
Hm. Why did you do that, doctor?

506
00:31:09,416 --> 00:31:11,333
Oh, Yuta…

507
00:31:11,958 --> 00:31:14,333
Um… Koropokkuru told me you were here.

508
00:31:18,500 --> 00:31:20,000
That was scary.

509
00:31:20,083 --> 00:31:22,375
I-I was terrified. Thank you.

510
00:31:24,333 --> 00:31:25,708
It's okay, you're okay now.

511
00:31:25,791 --> 00:31:27,958
I just got so caught up
in having my own fan for once--

512
00:31:31,625 --> 00:31:34,333
You better never go near Mio
dressed like that again!

513
00:31:34,416 --> 00:31:37,416
- Pathetic loser! You got that?
- Takeru! Takeru, stop! No!

514
00:31:37,500 --> 00:31:40,375
He's a doctor from the clinic!
He was just trying to help me!

515
00:31:42,250 --> 00:31:43,458
My bad.

516
00:31:44,041 --> 00:31:45,541
I'm sure it looked weird.

517
00:31:46,833 --> 00:31:48,416
Ah, ow, ow, ow, ow.

518
00:32:01,791 --> 00:32:04,041
- Thank you so much again.
- Yeah.

519
00:32:06,416 --> 00:32:09,250
I'm guessing you've been keeping
an eye on the Fairy Café?

520
00:32:10,375 --> 00:32:13,750
- Hello!
- Welcome! Can I offer you…

521
00:32:15,000 --> 00:32:16,416
The rumors I heard…

522
00:32:16,916 --> 00:32:21,333
were that that place was known
for some, uh… really shady things.

523
00:32:23,583 --> 00:32:25,416
So, just like Hijiri would,

524
00:32:25,916 --> 00:32:29,208
you were just trying to protect
Mio from danger, huh?

525
00:32:32,958 --> 00:32:34,625
Yeah, well, that didn't work.

526
00:32:36,000 --> 00:32:39,166
Apparently, I just… made things worse.

527
00:32:42,166 --> 00:32:45,000
I like… anime characters too,

528
00:32:46,000 --> 00:32:48,333
but that doesn't mean
I don't like real girls.

529
00:32:50,125 --> 00:32:53,458
It's complicated, I guess.
I thought that Mio understood.

530
00:32:55,375 --> 00:32:58,125
I really thought she was into it
when she invited me to her home.

531
00:33:00,166 --> 00:33:03,500
And that's why you said
those awful things? Because of that?

532
00:33:07,166 --> 00:33:10,541
Yeah, but after that,
I started doing my research.

533
00:33:11,041 --> 00:33:13,458
I learned a lot,
when it comes to sexual consent.

534
00:33:18,416 --> 00:33:21,125
So you realized that just because
a girl invites you to her room,

535
00:33:21,708 --> 00:33:25,250
that doesn't automatically mean that
she's consenting to have sex, yeah?

536
00:33:27,458 --> 00:33:28,458
Yeah.

537
00:33:33,291 --> 00:33:34,208
Mio…

538
00:33:35,166 --> 00:33:36,083
I…

539
00:33:38,875 --> 00:33:40,750
You need to know I'm really sorry.

540
00:33:44,291 --> 00:33:47,875
Do you…
think we could be friends again, please?

541
00:34:01,291 --> 00:34:04,083
Just know that you don't owe anyone
an answer at this moment.

542
00:34:20,083 --> 00:34:21,958
I'm sorry I waited until now,

543
00:34:22,458 --> 00:34:24,750
but why are you dressed like Hijiri,
doctor?

544
00:34:26,791 --> 00:34:28,041
Oh!

545
00:34:29,625 --> 00:34:31,958
I'm not gonna lie,
you kinda got me hooked on it.

546
00:34:32,041 --> 00:34:33,666
I'm obsessed with him too, a little bit.

547
00:34:35,166 --> 00:34:37,166
It's funny showing up here
dressed like him.

548
00:34:37,250 --> 00:34:39,791
Gave me a little more courage,
you know what I mean?

549
00:34:46,125 --> 00:34:47,166
Mm.

550
00:34:57,666 --> 00:34:58,666
I guess…

551
00:35:01,416 --> 00:35:04,833
the three of us are…
officially <i>oshikatsu </i>buddies, then?

552
00:35:06,958 --> 00:35:08,000
Eh?

553
00:35:12,333 --> 00:35:14,916
Maybe we should go check out inside.
We're already here, right?

554
00:35:17,500 --> 00:35:19,833
Hurry, finish your drink!
Come on, you too!

555
00:35:19,916 --> 00:35:20,916
Okay!

556
00:35:22,625 --> 00:35:24,750
Here, I'll help you. Do you want syrup?

557
00:35:25,791 --> 00:35:27,083
I know I don't need any.

558
00:35:29,791 --> 00:35:32,458
Ooh, that's a good one! I'll send it.

559
00:35:32,541 --> 00:35:35,750
KENSEIKITAN FES!

560
00:35:37,583 --> 00:35:38,875
Hmm?

561
00:35:38,958 --> 00:35:41,291
You're my first 3D fave, I guess.

562
00:35:44,250 --> 00:35:45,250
Huh?

563
00:35:46,583 --> 00:35:49,083
I'd like to thank you, doctor.

564
00:35:49,166 --> 00:35:51,000
Doctor, move in a little.

565
00:35:51,083 --> 00:35:52,500
Oh, yeah, sure.

566
00:35:54,583 --> 00:35:56,916
You know, I should be thanking you too.

567
00:35:58,916 --> 00:36:02,833
I learned about…
how love can look different to each of us.

568
00:36:03,375 --> 00:36:05,875
Like, who's the patient
and who's the doctor?

569
00:36:08,250 --> 00:36:09,333
Ready, then?

570
00:36:09,416 --> 00:36:10,916
- Yeah.
- Yes.

571
00:36:11,625 --> 00:36:13,708
Even if it's not a physical relationship,

572
00:36:13,791 --> 00:36:17,416
you can always…
still cultivate a connection.

573
00:36:19,291 --> 00:36:22,708
So, thank you for my…
prescription, Dr. Mio.

574
00:36:28,208 --> 00:36:29,500
Uh… you're welcome?

575
00:36:29,583 --> 00:36:32,000
Man, that couldn't have been fun,

576
00:36:32,500 --> 00:36:34,166
Koropokkuru.

577
00:36:34,750 --> 00:36:36,750
I never wanna hear that again.

578
00:36:37,625 --> 00:36:40,041
You know what's nuts, though?
We keep doing what the doc says.

579
00:36:40,125 --> 00:36:42,541
Mm, yeah. Sometimes it's a bit much.

580
00:36:42,625 --> 00:36:45,166
- It's just frustrating.
- Okay, give him a break.

581
00:36:45,250 --> 00:36:47,416
No. It's me, not him.

582
00:36:48,083 --> 00:36:50,083
I'm frustrated I always let him do it.

583
00:36:51,208 --> 00:36:54,916
No matter what he asks me to do,
somehow I always end up doing it.

584
00:36:56,416 --> 00:36:58,708
I even enjoy it a little sometimes.

585
00:37:00,458 --> 00:37:02,958
Have you considered
maybe you like this, don't you?

586
00:37:03,041 --> 00:37:06,333
Look, I know it's weird, but
I get why Professor Kurusu suggested it.

587
00:37:07,666 --> 00:37:09,208
Oh my God, stop!

588
00:37:09,291 --> 00:37:12,541
There's no way that I'm gonna be
a male nurse for the rest of my life.

589
00:37:12,625 --> 00:37:14,125
Oh, sorry.

590
00:37:14,208 --> 00:37:17,208
Yuta, Marin,
you're both good to go for the day.

591
00:37:17,291 --> 00:37:18,708
Thanks. See ya tomorrow.

592
00:37:21,666 --> 00:37:25,291
<i>Everything! I just love them so much.</i>

593
00:37:25,375 --> 00:37:27,541
<i>And when you love something,</i>
<i>you work for it.</i>

594
00:37:27,625 --> 00:37:29,000
<i>You agree with me, right?</i>

595
00:37:29,083 --> 00:37:31,375
IS REAL LOVE FOR 2D CHARACTERS
DRIVING THE OSHIKATSU BOOM?

596
00:37:31,458 --> 00:37:33,916
- Huh, is that a feature on Hijiri?
- <i>Yes, I agree.</i>

597
00:37:34,000 --> 00:37:35,458
Getting more and more into it, huh?

598
00:37:35,541 --> 00:37:38,666
- <i>This event is extremely popular…</i>
- Ah, yeah.

599
00:37:38,750 --> 00:37:41,125
Who is the woman again
who's reporting that? Huh?

600
00:37:41,208 --> 00:37:42,500
Yumi Ichinose?

601
00:37:42,583 --> 00:37:45,333
Oh, right that's her.
God, she's pretty hot, isn't she?

602
00:37:46,250 --> 00:37:47,875
I wouldn't kick her out of bed!

603
00:37:47,958 --> 00:37:50,458
As I said, I think it's time
you both go home now, please?

604
00:37:50,541 --> 00:37:52,500
Hold on. Am I nuts, doctor?

605
00:37:52,583 --> 00:37:54,583
Didn't you get a call
from an Ichinose earlier?

606
00:37:54,666 --> 00:37:56,833
- Huh?
- Oh, yeah. You're right.

607
00:38:03,083 --> 00:38:04,541
Wishing you both good night.

608
00:38:05,750 --> 00:38:07,000
- What?
- Huh?

609
00:38:09,125 --> 00:38:11,583
Wait! Oh my God! Oh my God! Oh my God!

610
00:38:11,666 --> 00:38:15,791
- Nah, nah, nah, nah, nah, nah.
- No, no way, no way, no way, no way.

611
00:38:16,458 --> 00:38:18,125
- Could it?
- Huh?

612
00:38:21,208 --> 00:38:23,708
So? How is he?

613
00:38:25,333 --> 00:38:29,166
You know I can't say anything,
due to doctor-patient confidentiality.

614
00:38:31,625 --> 00:38:33,666
Are you really calling him a patient?

615
00:38:33,750 --> 00:38:35,583
He's more like an experiment to you.

616
00:38:35,666 --> 00:38:39,583
I think that's a pretty harsh way
to put it, don't you think?

617
00:38:41,125 --> 00:38:42,125
Well…

618
00:38:46,916 --> 00:38:49,666
I'll be keeping an eye
on this whole thing.

619
00:39:04,416 --> 00:39:06,041
Hmm.

620
00:39:08,708 --> 00:39:10,875
Ichito?

621
00:39:12,375 --> 00:39:14,750
Yeah, it's… it's me. What's up?

622
00:39:16,750 --> 00:39:18,666
You're the one who called, silly.

623
00:39:21,166 --> 00:39:22,500
So…

624
00:39:23,458 --> 00:39:25,166
Um, I was wondering…

625
00:39:26,708 --> 00:39:29,333
if maybe you would wanna meet up again?

626
00:39:30,958 --> 00:39:33,708
<i>Even without</i>
<i>physical touch in the relationship,</i>

627
00:39:33,791 --> 00:39:35,375
<i>you can still feel connected.</i>

628
00:39:37,125 --> 00:39:39,666
<i>Maybe I should listen</i>
<i>to my own advice sometimes.</i>

629
00:39:39,750 --> 00:39:41,041
<i>Seems to work on my patients.</i>

630
00:39:42,125 --> 00:39:43,791
- Hm.
- You know what?

631
00:39:45,041 --> 00:39:48,041
I love how you say things like
"sexual consent." It's refreshing.

632
00:39:48,125 --> 00:39:49,208
Mm.

633
00:39:49,833 --> 00:39:52,750
Well, some people think that romance

634
00:39:53,250 --> 00:39:55,333
is a bad return on investment.

635
00:39:57,583 --> 00:40:01,666
Okay, but I think there's
much value in finding love.

636
00:40:42,333 --> 00:40:43,958
- Whoa!
- Ah! Ah.

637
00:40:45,750 --> 00:40:48,208
- Ah! Whoa. You okay?
- Sorry, sorry.

638
00:40:48,916 --> 00:40:51,625
Jeez! It's really coming down.

639
00:40:53,458 --> 00:40:55,916
My bad for saying
we should hit another bar.

640
00:40:56,916 --> 00:40:57,916
No.

641
00:40:58,416 --> 00:41:01,333
Wow, look at that. What a squall.

642
00:41:01,416 --> 00:41:03,541
Ah. It's not really a squall.

643
00:41:04,791 --> 00:41:05,791
Huh?

644
00:41:07,291 --> 00:41:09,041
I wouldn't call it a squall.

645
00:41:09,541 --> 00:41:13,875
To be really specific, a squall usually
involves heavy wind, not just rain.

646
00:41:14,500 --> 00:41:17,291
Says the… former weather lady.

647
00:41:17,375 --> 00:41:19,583
Oh, stop it.

648
00:41:20,208 --> 00:41:21,083
Oh.

649
00:41:22,833 --> 00:41:25,666
- Want this?
- Oh.

650
00:41:26,458 --> 00:41:27,541
Thank you.

651
00:41:30,916 --> 00:41:32,375
So, what should we do?

652
00:41:33,125 --> 00:41:35,041
We'll catch a cold out here.

653
00:41:35,125 --> 00:41:37,125
Oh, I guess, yeah.

654
00:41:38,333 --> 00:41:39,875
I'll grab a taxi.

655
00:41:54,750 --> 00:41:56,375
When you want something,

656
00:41:57,833 --> 00:41:59,291
you work for it.

657
00:42:01,791 --> 00:42:03,125
Ichito!

658
00:42:24,000 --> 00:42:25,791
Forgive me.

659
00:42:28,250 --> 00:42:29,875
I should've asked before.

660
00:42:30,666 --> 00:42:32,666
Even with just kissing,
you need consent, right?

661
00:42:41,666 --> 00:42:42,791
I just…

662
00:42:45,083 --> 00:42:46,916
care about you a lot.

663
00:42:49,166 --> 00:42:50,500
I did before…

664
00:42:51,875 --> 00:42:53,000
and I never stopped.

665
00:42:58,500 --> 00:42:59,666
Can I…

666
00:43:07,083 --> 00:43:08,291
Can I?
